#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:128
msgid "Lassen, a Linux Power9 BlueOS cluster"
msgstr "Lassen（Linux Power9 BlueOS 集群）"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:130
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:332
msgid "``build_visit`` was run to generate the third party libraries. In this case the system MPI was used, so information about the system MPI had to be provided with environment variables and the ``--parallel`` flag had to be specified. In this case, a few of the optional third party libraries do not build on the system so all the desired optional third party libraries had to be explicitly listed. Also, the system OpenGL implementation was outdated and ``--mesagl`` had to be included to provide an OpenGL implementation suitable for VisIt_. Lastly, the Uintah library was built to enable building the Uintah reader."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``build_visit`` 以生成第三方库。在该案例中使用系统 MPI，因此需要通过环境变量提供系统 MPI 的相关信息，并且需要指定 ``--parallel``。该案例中有少数可选第三方库无法在该系统上构建，因此需要显式列出想要构建的所有可选第三方库。此外，系统 OpenGL 实现过旧，需要包含 ``--mesagl`` 以提供适用于 VisIt_ 的 OpenGL 实现。最后，为了启用 Uintah 读取器，还构建了 Uintah 库。"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:156
msgid "This built the third party libraries and generated a ``lassen708.cmake`` config site file. The ``Setup VISITHOME & VISITARCH variables.`` section was changed to"
msgstr ""
"这会构建第三方库并生成 ``lassen708.cmake`` config-site 文件。将 ``Setup VISITHOME & VISITARCH variables.`` 这一节改为"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:199
msgid "Cori, a Cray KNL cluster"
msgstr "Cori（Cray KNL 集群）"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:201
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:418
msgid "The system is set up to support the Intel compiler by default so we need to swap out the Intel environment for the GNU environment."
msgstr ""
"系统默认配置为支持 Intel 编译器，因此需要将 Intel 环境切换为 GNU 环境。"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:208
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:425
msgid "The Cray compiler wrappers are set up to do static linking, which causes a problem with building parallel hdf5. The linking can be changed to link dynamically by setting a couple of environment variables."
msgstr ""
"Cray 编译器封装器默认进行静态链接，这会导致并行 hdf5 构建出现问题。可以通过设置几个环境变量将链接方式改为动态链接。"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:217
msgid "The linker has a bug that prevents VTK from building, which is fixed with the linker in binutils 2.32. Binutils was then manually built with the following steps."
msgstr ""
"链接器存在一个 bug，导致 VTK 无法构建；binutils 2.32 中的链接器修复了该问题。随后按以下步骤手动构建 binutils。"
