#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:247
msgid "``build_visit`` was run to generate the third party libraries. In this case the system MPI was used, so information about the system MPI had to be provided with environment variables and the ``--parallel`` flag had to be specified. In this case, all the required and optional third party libraries built without problem, so ``--required --optional`` could be used. Also, the system OpenGL implementation was outdated and ``--mesagl`` had to be included to provide an OpenGL implementation suitable for VisIt_. Lastly, the Uintah library was built to enable building the Uintah reader."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``build_visit`` 以生成第三方库。在该案例中使用系统 MPI，因此需要通过环境变量提供系统 MPI 的相关信息，并且需要指定 ``--parallel``。该案例中所有必需与可选的第三方库都能顺利构建，因此可以使用 ``--required --optional``。此外，系统 OpenGL 实现过旧，需要包含 ``--mesagl`` 以提供适用于 VisIt_ 的 OpenGL 实现。最后，为了启用 Uintah 读取器，还构建了 Uintah 库。"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:267
msgid "This built the third party libraries and generated a ``cori08.cmake`` config site file. The ``Setup VISITHOME & VISITARCH variables.`` section was changed to"
