msgid "The compiler didn't like one of the boost header files, so it was manually patched."
msgstr ""
"编译器无法接受某个 boost 头文件，因此对其进行了手动补丁。"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:416
msgid "Trinity, a Cray KNL cluster"
msgstr "Trinity（Cray KNL 集群）"
#: building_visit/Common_Build_Scenarios.rst:434
msgid "``build_visit`` was run to generate the third party libraries. In this case the system MPI was used, so information about the system MPI had to be provided with environment variables and the ``--parallel`` flag had to be specified. In this case, all the required and optional third party libraries built except for Sphinx and Mili, so ``--no-sphinx --no-mili`` in addition to ``--required --optional`` could be used. Also, the system OpenGL implementation was outdated and ``--mesagl`` had to be included to provide an OpenGL implementation suitable for VisIt_."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``build_visit`` 以生成第三方库。在该案例中使用系统 MPI，因此需要通过环境变量提供系统 MPI 的相关信息，并且需要指定 ``--parallel``。该案例中除 Sphinx 和 Mili 外，所有必需与可选的第三方库都能顺利构建，因此除了 ``--required --optional`` 之外，还可以使用 ``--no-sphinx --no-mili``。此外，系统 OpenGL 实现过旧，需要包含 ``--mesagl`` 以提供适用于 VisIt_ 的 OpenGL 实现。"
